"use strict";$(document).ready(function(){var n=$("#Id").val(),t=$("#NickName").val();$("#viewhistoryjobgrade").click(function(){var i="/employee/ViewHistoryJobGrade/"+n;$.get(i,function(n){$("#dialog-show-history-jobgrade").html(n);$("#dialog-show-history-jobgrade").dialog({modal:!0,height:"auto",width:"auto",title:t+"'s Job Grade",show:{effect:"fade",duration:300},hide:{effect:"fade",duration:200}})})});$("#viewhistorymanagementgrade").click(function(){var i="/employee/ViewHistoryManagementGrade/"+n;$.get(i,function(n){$("#dialog-show-history-jobgrade").html(n);$("#dialog-show-history-jobgrade").dialog({modal:!0,height:"auto",width:"auto",title:t+"'s Management Grade",show:{effect:"fade",duration:300},hide:{effect:"fade",duration:200}})})})});